WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A rubber hand sits on a table. The real hand is hidden.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
When seen and felt touches line up, something surprising can happen.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The object can begin to feel like part of you. But why?

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Researchers have tested sensory timing, expectation, and suggestibility.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
An experience is real as a report. A mechanism needs a better test.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Before buying focus audio, look for evidence about that recording.
